  "ambiguous": {
    "_comment": [
      "Dial codes shared by several countries. The adapter resolves these using",
      "the country NAME OnlineSim returns alongside the code, and skips the",
      "offering entirely if the name is not one listed here - rather than",
      "defaulting to the largest country, which is how a customer ends up buying",
      "a Canadian number believing it is American."
